msgid "Every field group stored in this site’s database already has a translation setup."
msgstr "Chaque groupe de champs stocké dans la base de données de ce site possède déjà une configuration de traduction."

#. translators: Button that returns to the translation setup screen. Verb phrase, imperative.
#: classes/FieldGroup/SetupScreen.php:276
